     "text": "```json\n{\"reachable\": false, \"rationale\": \"Starting only from wifiGuest:initialAccess, the attacker can reach containerHost:execution, configSecret:credentialAccess, fileServer:lateralMovement, memoryDump:credentialAccess, rdpLogin:authenticate and mailArchive:collection. Nothing else opens up. browserStore, tokenCache, iotDevice, ssoLogin, sshKey and dmzWeb each depend on footholds the attacker does not have (internet, phishing, supplychain, vpnGateway, exposedApi). As a result, backupHost, jumpHost, printServer, dbLogin, vpnSession, domainAdmin, serviceAccount, secretsManager, appServer and hypervisor all stay unreachable. That leaves every parent of crownData:exfiltrate unreachable: shareMount, vaultRead, dbReplica and codeRepo.\"}\n```"
